{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DaGkziVpcdgwwB1XoBS3bR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Control Surface â€” Master Plan (frozen design)\n\n**North Star (locked)**\n- Transform Anchor from a task/project tracker into a **per-project R&D control surface**, where each code project is a folder (e.g. `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`, `C:\\dev\\Anchor`).\n- A single-instance dashboard window drives the **researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman** trio as durable, server-owned Claude Code jobs on **gwl-server**.\n- Scope spans versioned effort history, taskâ†”project integration, project lifecycle states, deliverable execution, and a **data-free public distribution**.\n\n**Locked design decisions**\n- **D1 â€” One uniform job primitive:** a job is `claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json` running the relevant **skill** (researchPrime / crucible / foreman) in the project cwd, **owned by the Anchor server**. A lane = which skill + prompt template. No per-lane orchestration code, no PTY, stdlib only.\n- **D2 â€” Gate handling is in-session:** a skill's `AskUserQuestion` gate surfaces in the stream (auto-dismisses headless, but the structured question stays visible); Anchor renders it in a prompt box and sends the user's choice back as a plain-text turn to continue the run.\n\n**Locked user decisions (Decision Log, Crucible 2026-06-07/08)**\n- **Brownfield** extension of Anchor (`C:\\dev\\Anchor`); objective = new capability.\n- **Session model:** streaming console, **stdlib-only** (not a full TUI; no PTY/deps).\n- **Registry:** a new **parallel R&D registry**, distinct from life-domain projects.\n- **Artifacts:** stored inside each project's `.anchor/` as pointer-records; engine outputs stay native.\n- **v1 scope:** all three trio lanes, **Claude Code CLI only** (Gemini deferred).\n- **Auth:** run the Anchor service as **`john`** to resolve the LocalSystem credential wall.\n- **Remote:** bind the **Tailscale** interface + a **shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*`.\n\n**Member documents**\n- Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, Decision Log.\n\n*Note: the Decision Log records adversarial findings (Crucible) as the rationale behind each locked decision.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34947,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34947},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c1dc839-585f-45bb-8035-53879e273917","uuid":"4579def9-823b-4b6d-871e-3c9124395680","request_id":"req_011Cc52sHBKmuCdJPKPN4Wcb"}
